Sift flour, salt, soda and spices together. Cream shortening; add sugar gradually and cream until fluffy. Add eggs one at a time, beating well after each addition. Add vanilla. Add combine vinegar and sour cream alternately with dry ingredients; beat until smooth. Fold in nuts. Pour into 2 greased 9-inch layer cake pans or into greased cup cake pans. Bake at 375 F. for 25 to 30 minutes for layers;

20 to 25 minutes for cup cakes.

